<hi rendition="#et">ler &#x017F;ind.</hi></l></lg></div><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b">GOtt</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="304" facs="#f0320"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">GOtt i&#x017F;t die Liebe.</fw><lb/>
<div n="1"><head><hi rendition="#b">GOtt i&#x017F;t die Liebe.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#in">W</hi>enn ich den gro&#x017F;&#x017F;en <hi rendition="#fr">GOtt,</hi> mir in Ge-<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">danken bilde,</hi></l><lb/>
<l>Die Eigen&#x017F;chaften &#x017F;eh, die unbegreif-<lb/>
